<title>GERMANY: Suedzucker increases half-year net.</title>
<headline>Suedzucker increases half-year net.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31. (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			 140	 vs 115</p>
<p>    Group sales			    3,612	 vs 3,553</p>
<p>    Parent sales			     940	 vs 992</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German food manufacturer is Suedzucker AG. The company said it expected full-year sales to rise to 7.6 billion marks from 7.5 billion, while earnings growth would substantially outstrip sales.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
